    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4253" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλί-πλοος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, 
			contr.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἁλί-πλους</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ουν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>covered with
