					12.26
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> later 
				Act.
			, <i>sailing on the sea</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ναῦς</span>”
